  "description": "Tech is gaining strength, Buffett has a disadvantage you don’t, and 52 stocks just became 2.",
  "body_html": "<p>Many people throw away the greatest strength they have as a retail investor:</p><h4><em>Agility in the markets, being able to enter and exit positions instantly. </em></h4><p>Do you think Warren Buffett has that? If he had a bad stock pick, he could instantly cut the loss? No… when you have millions or billions in a single asset, liquidity issues arise in exiting or entering stocks. If you get a stock pick incorrect, which will inevitably happen at some point, you can quickly cut the small loss, before it gets to be a huge loss! </p><h4>We let our winners get out of control, our losers are kept under control. </h4><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>I’m not saying Buffett is “bad,” but I am saying that he is NOT the best, especially for retail investors like you and I. You are not a billionaire, so stop using billionaire strategies for your portfolio. It’s a totally different ball game with them. </p><h4><strong>Do not throw away your biggest strength in the markets: Speed! </strong></h4><p>Watch the video, where I explain why Chubb stock is not a buy today. Price action needs to get above ~$350 for me to even consider it (which may happen!). You do not need to catch the bottom. </p><p>Think about it… we see the Buffett Bandwagon always cheering for Buffet. </p><p>How often do you see the bandwagon win?</p><div><hr></div><h4><strong>General Market Update</strong></h4><p><strong>T</strong>he NASDAQ hit all time highs on Tuesday. The S&amp;P 500 got incredibly close. As much as I love endless, continuous, green candles, we cannot expect that every single day. There are pull backs. There are consolidations. I know… boring, but that is how it goes. </p><p>We have not seen any major, reputable blue chip stocks “snap” or break down. And trend remains bullish for the major indexes. The VIX continues to make lower highs and lower lows. We watched Finance, a stock market sector leader, take off since February, and now we are starting to see the tech sector demonstrate strength… which will often times pull the remaining sectors behind it. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!64zS!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79c47ab7-04de-44b8-8bde-e5df7809af1c_1254x765.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!64zS!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79c47ab7-04de-44b8-8bde-e5df7809af1c_1254x765.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!64zS!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79c47ab7-04de-44b8-8bde-e5df7809af1c_1254x765.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!64zS!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79c47ab7-04de-44b8-8bde-e5df7809af1c_1254x765.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!64zS!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79c47ab7-04de-44b8-8bde-e5df7809af1c_1254x765.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!64zS!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79c47ab7-04de-44b8-8bde-e5df7809af1c_1254x765.png\" width=\"1254\" height=\"765\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/79c47ab7-04de-44b8-8bde-e5df7809af1c_1254x765.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:765,&quot;width&quot;:1254,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:155311,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/217235824?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79c47ab7-04de-44b8-8bde-e5df7809af1c_1254x765.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!64zS!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79c47ab7-04de-44b8-8bde-e5df7809af1c_1254x765.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!64zS!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79c47ab7-04de-44b8-8bde-e5df7809af1c_1254x765.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!64zS!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79c47ab7-04de-44b8-8bde-e5df7809af1c_1254x765.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!64zS!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F79c47ab7-04de-44b8-8bde-e5df7809af1c_1254x765.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">New all time highs on 22 September. Trend is friend. Stick with it until price action proves otherwise, despite what you read in the headlines. </figcaption></figure></div><h4>Point being: We are not seeing any “imminent bear market” signals. We remain in a well defined bull market…despite the boring days and the negative headlines. </h4><div><hr></div><h4>Tech Sector Leading the Market</h4><p>Have mentioned this a few times in prior videos about Finance and Tech showing renewed strength. That was demonstrated in yesterday’s Midweek Movers stock rankings. If you are unfamiliar with this series, this is where I rank your favorite stocks from worst to first. We had 52 stocks go in, and 2 came out… both of which I purchased yesterday. You can see the process of finding these stocks and the winner assets here ⬇️</p><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/52-stocks-went-in-these-2-came-out?r=4z8lgl\">(</a><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/52-stocks-went-in-these-2-came-out?r=4z8lgl\">9/23) Tech Stocks Win Midweek Mover Market Rankings(click here)</a></strong></h4><div><hr></div><p>Market is pretty quiet for now. But don’t let that fool you. It is always quiet before it gets turbulent. </p><p>If you have questions, feel free to stop by the main chat; or just come and say hello. We have several great traders and investors in there; including several financial advisors lurking in the background (yes, I see you LOL). </p><p>Be sure to like ❤️ and re-stack 🔄 this post. It helps fight AI slop. </p><p>Thanks for stopping by!</p><p>-Timothy, aka StockTok</p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W3S9!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8add7fc9-8edc-4748-ba33-360428e75ee1_1206x1206.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
